!include ../_style.puml

title 程式元件閱讀路徑圖
top to bottom direction

rectangle "非 UML：由入口追到規則與資料" as Label
rectangle "前端入口\nmain.jsx / App.jsx / AdminApp.jsx" as FrontEntry
rectangle "角色頁面與服務\nDashboardApp / pages / api.js" as FrontService
rectangle "HTTP 入口\nroutes / middleware" as Routes
rectangle "請求協調\ncontrollers" as Controllers
rectangle "業務規則\nservices" as Services
rectangle "資料契約\nmodels / MongoDB" as Models
rectangle "AI 處理入口\nmain.py / batch_main.py" as PipelineEntry
rectangle "Pipeline stages\ncheckpoint / chunk / embedding / uploader" as PipelineStages

Label -[hidden]-> FrontEntry
FrontEntry --> FrontService : page and session
FrontService --> Routes : HTTPS JSON / multipart
Routes --> Controllers : validated request
Controllers --> Services : use-case input
Services --> Models : query / persist
Services --> PipelineEntry : guarded process request
PipelineEntry --> PipelineStages : run / resume / batch
PipelineStages --> Models : publication + webhook

note bottom of Services
  第9章只擇優呈現能說明授權、狀態轉換與來源式回答的程式片段；
  完整程式以 repository 為準，不以大量貼碼充頁。
end note

@enduml
